\v 5 This idea pleased¦85916 the group, so they¦85928 went ahead¦85920 and chose¦85928 Stephen¦85931 (a man¦85932 full¦85933 of faith¦85935 and of the holy¦85940 \nd spirit¦85938\nd*), Philip¦85942, Procorus, Nikanor¦85946, Timon¦85948, Parmenas¦85950, and Nicolas¦85952 (a non-Jew from¦85954 Antioch¦85954 who had previously converted¦85953 to Judaism).
