\v 8 Now Stephen¦85999 \add (one of the seven)\add* was full¦86001 of grace¦86002 and power and was doing¦86006 miracles¦86009 and amazing demonstrations of God's power among¦86011 the¦86012 people¦86013.
\v 9 But¦86032 a group from the¦86037 Freedmen¦86031 Synagogue¦86026 as well as \add Jews\add* from Cyrene¦86033, Alexandria¦86035, Cilicia¦86039, and Asia¦86041 \add Minor\add* rose¦86020 up¦86020 and started arguing against Stephen¦86044,
