\v 43 You¦87219 turned to Molech's¦87223 tent¦87221 and¦87218 Refan's star¦87226 as your¦87229 gods¦87228 by making¦87235 images¦87232 of¦87223 them¦87237 to bow down to. So¦87218 for that¦87234, I'll¦87239 send you¦87219 all¦87219 away into exile beyond¦87244 Babylon¦87245.’
\p
\v 44 The¦87246 tent¦87247 of¦87255 evidence was¦87250 with¦87252 our¦87255 ancestors¦87253 in¦87256 the¦87257 wilderness¦87258—made¦87266 to¦87265 the¦87270 pattern¦87272 that¦87273 God had¦87274 shown Mosheh¦87265.\x + \xo 7:44: \xt Exo 25:9,40.\x*
\v 45 Our¦87282 ancestors¦87281 then carried that¦87276 tent into the land, having¦87279 inherited¦87279 it along with¦87283 \nd Joshua¦87284\nd* from¦87295 the¦87287 possession¦87288 of the pagans which¦87276 \nd God¦87294\nd* drove¦87292 out¦87292 ahead of them. The¦87297 tent remained there until¦87301 the¦87302 time¦87303 of David¦87304\x + \xo 7:45: \xt Josh 3:14-17.\x*
\v 46 who¦87305 found¦87306 favour¦87307 with \nd God¦87310\nd* and¦87311 requested¦87312 to¦87313 find¦87313 a tent¦87314 for¦87316 the¦87316 house¦87317 of¦87319 Yacob¦87319,\x + \xo 7:46: \xt 2Sam 7:1-16; 1Ch 17:1-14.\x*
\v 47 but¦87321 it was Solomon¦87320 who built¦87322 the¦87325 house¦87325 for¦87324 God \add to reside in\add*.\x + \xo 7:47: \xt 1Ki 6:1-38; 2Ch 3:1-17.\x*
\p
