\v 54 When¦87446 they heard¦87444 that, they were¦87454 raging inside and¦87446 grating¦87454 their¦87456 teeth¦87457 at¦87458 him¦87459.
\v 55 But¦87474 being¦87460 full¦87462 of the holy¦87466 \nd spirit¦87465\nd*, Stephen stared up into¦87468 the¦87469 sky¦87470 and¦87474 was able to see God's splendour¦87472, as well as seeing \nd Yeshua¦87475\nd* standing¦87478 there on God's right¦87480.
\v 56 He said¦87486, “I can look¦87487 through the sky that's opened¦87491 up¦87491 and¦87493 can see the¦87494 son¦87495 of¦87497 humanity¦87497 standing¦87501 at \nd God's¦87503\nd* right¦87500 side.”
\p
\v 57 At this point, they¦87508 blocked their¦87511 ears¦87510 and¦87512 rushed¦87513 together to grab Stephen, yelling loudly¦87507.
