\v 10 So¦94881 as a result of the¦94884 vision¦94885, we¦94892 decided to go straight to Macedonia¦94896, concluding¦94897 that¦94898 \nd God¦94902\nd* had¦94899 called¦94899 us¦94900 to share the good message with them¦94905.
\s1 Lydia's enthusiasm at Philippi
