\p
\v 16 One time as we were walking to the¦95053 prayer¦95054 meeting, we met a female slave who¦95066 was¦95069 possessed by a spirit¦95059 that enabled her to tell fortunes¦95076, and¦95049 thanks to that, to earn a lot of¦95075 money for¦95071 her masters¦95072.
\v 17 She walked along behind us¦95084 and shouted¦95088 out¦95086, “These¦95089 men¦95091 are¦95097 slaves¦95092 of¦95104 the¦95095 highest¦95096 \nd god¦95094\nd* and they will¦95097 be telling¦95088 you¦95101 all¦95101 how to¦95101 be saved.”
\v 18 After she'd done¦95107 this¦95105 for¦95108 several¦95109 days¦95110, Paul¦95115 was¦95107 so frustrated that¦95105 he turned¦95117 around¦95118 and¦95106 spoke¦95122 to the¦95118 spirit¦95119 \add in her\add*, “I command¦95123 you¦95124 by¦95118 the authority of \nd Yeshua¦95128\nd* the \nd messiah¦95129\nd* to leave her.”
