\v 31 “Believe¦95412 in¦95414 the¦95415 \nd master¦95416 Yeshua¦95417\nd*,” they¦95409 replied¦95411, “then¦95410 you¦95420 and¦95410 your¦95425 household¦95424 can all be¦95420 saved¦95420.”
