\v 33 Even though it was¦95459 still the middle of¦95450 the night¦95451, he¦95453 sponged their¦95455 wounds¦95456, and then¦95442 him¦95467 and his¦95467 household were all¦95469 immersed¦95459 straight away.
\v 34 He¦95482 took Paul and Silas up¦95473 into¦95477 his house¦95479 and gave them¦95483 a meal, and his whole¦95490 household¦95490 were happy because they now believed¦95492 in \nd God¦95496\nd*.
