\p
\v 5 But¦95800 some of the other Jews¦95799 were¦95815 envious \add of them\add*, and enlisted some of the troublemakers from the¦95805 marketplaces¦95806 to¦95827 form¦95814 a mob¦95814. They¦95815 stirred up all the people, and looking¦95824 for¦95824 Paul and Silas so they¦95824 could bring¦95827 them out, arrived at the¦95821 house¦95822 of a man¦95808 named Jason.
