\v 7 and Jason has¦95863 welcomed¦95863 them \add into his house\add*. They rebel against Caesar's¦95871 decrees¦95870 and claim that \nd Yeshua¦95878\nd* is a rival king¦95873.”
\v 8 They¦95880 stirred up the¦95883 crowd¦95885 and¦95887 the¦95889 city¦95891 leaders with these¦95894 accusations,
