\v 10 So¦95908 the¦95907 believers¦95909 immediately¦95910 sent¦95915 Paul¦95918 and¦95919 Silas¦95921 off during the night¦95914 to go¦95933 to Berea. In Berea they also¦95919 attended at the \add ≈Jewish¦95929 meeting¦95929 hall¦95929\add*
\v 11 and this group were¦95936 more¦95938 upper-class than¦95938 the congregation in¦95940 Thessalonica¦95942. They eagerly accepted the¦95945 message¦95946 and examined¦95953 the¦95954 scriptures¦95955 every¦95951 day¦95952 to check if¦95956 what was being taught matched what was written there.
