\v 13 But¦96023 when¦95991 the¦95994 Jews¦95998 from¦95995 Thessalonica¦95997 found out that¦95999 \nd God's¦96011\nd* message¦96009 was¦96004 also¦96021 being proclaimed¦96004 by¦96005 Paul¦96007 there¦96021 in¦96001 Berea¦96003, they¦96018 soon turned up to agitate¦96022 and¦96023 stir the¦96025 crowds¦96026.
