\m
\v 29 So¦96450 since we are \nd God's¦96453\nd* offspring, we shouldn't¦96454 be¦96456 putting gold¦96458 or silver¦96462 or stone¦96464 craftsmanship¦96466 in the same class as the¦96471 divine¦96472.
\v 30 In fact \nd God¦96485\nd* overlooked¦96483 times¦96478 of¦96480 such ignorance¦96480 in the¦96479 past, but now¦96487 he's¦96488 informing everyone¦96496 and requiring them to¦96490 repent¦96497
\v 31 because he's set¦96500 a date¦96502 for when he's going¦96505 to be¦96506 fairly judging¦96506 the¦96508 world¦96509. He's¦96516 already appointed the judge who everyone¦96520 can have faith¦96517 in¦96510 because he brought¦96518 him¦96522 back to life from¦96523 the dead¦96524.
\p
\v 32 When¦96526 they¦96529 heard¦96525 about a dead¦96528 person coming back to life, some started mocking¦96531 but¦96526 others¦96533 said¦96534, “We'd like to hear¦96535 more about this¦96539 from¦96536 you¦96536 another time.”
