\v 34 but¦96551 some¦96550 people joined¦96553 with¦96571 him¦96555 and believed¦96556, including¦96565 Dionysius¦96560 who was a council member, a woman¦96566 named Damaris¦96568, and others¦96570 as well.
\c 18
