\v 5 However when¦96682 Silas¦96692 and¦96693 Timothy¦96695 arrived from¦96686 Macedonia¦96688, Paul¦96701 was¦96696 able to devote his full time to the¦96697 message¦96698—demonstrating to the¦96703 Jews¦96704 that \nd Yeshua¦96709\nd* is the \add promised\add* \nd messiah¦96707\nd*.
