\v 7 So¦96751 Paul left there¦96756, and went¦96757 to stay at the house of¦96763 a man named Titos Justus who worshipped¦96769 \nd God¦96771\nd* and whose house was¦96775 next-door to the¦96777 meeting¦96778 hall¦96778.
