\v 12 Then at the time when Gallio¦96879 was the proconsul¦96883 of¦96886 Achaia¦96886, the¦96889 Jews¦96890 united against Paul¦96898 and¦96900 brought a case to¦96907 the¦96908 tribunal¦96909 against him¦96905
