\p
\v 28 So¦105057 now let¦105058 it¦105058 be¦105058 known¦105056 to you¦105059 all¦105059 that¦105065 the¦105066 \add message of\add* salvation¦105067 from \nd God¦105069\nd* has been sent¦105064 out¦105064 to non-Jews and¦105071 they¦105070 will¦105072 listen.”
\p
\v 29 ◘
\v 30 Paul remained¦105085 in his own¦105094 rental¦105095 accommodation in Rome for two¦105091 whole¦105092 years¦105091 and¦105096 welcomed¦105097 everyone¦105098 who went to¦105101 see him¦105102,
